s.io/docs/concepts/extend-kubernetes/api-extension/custom-resources/ and .../operator/ |\n666:| G18 | **Flux** as the other graduated GitOps engine. Appears only as a name in the graduated-projects roster; Argo CD gets a full source. A KCNA question contrasting the two is plausible. | D3.1 | fluxcd.io docs |\n667:| G19 | **Kustomize.** Named inside the Argo CD and Helm-adjacent material as a manifest source, never explained. Overlay/base model is worth one paragraph. | D3.1 | kubectl kustomize docs |","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
